>include_extensions</code>。</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"api-entry\" id=\"std.Build.Step.WriteFile.create\"><h3><code>std.Build.Step.WriteFile.create</code></h3>\n<p class=\"api-kind\">函数</p>\n<p class=\"api-source\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><a href=\"#L50\">第 50 行</a></p>\n<pre class=\"api-prototype\"><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">pub</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">create</span>(owner: *<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/#std\">std</a>.<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/Build/#std.Build\">Build</a>) *<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/Build/Step/WriteFile/#std.Build.Step.WriteFile\">WriteFile</a></code></pre>\n<h4>参数</h4><div class=\"api-parameters\">\n<pre><code>owner: *<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/#std\">std</a>.<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/Build/#std.Build\">Build</a></code></pre>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"api-entry\" id=\"std.Build.Step.WriteFile.Directory\"><h3><code>std.Build.Step.WriteFile.Directory</code></h3>\n<p class=\"api-kind\">容器</p>\n<p class=\"api-source\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><a href=\"#L43\">第 43 行</a></p>\n<h4>字段</h4><div class=\"api-fields\">\n<pre><code>sub_path: <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/Build/Configuration/#std.Build.Configuration\">Configuration</a>.<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/Build/Configuration/#std.Build.Configuration.String\">String</a></code></pre><div class=\"fieldDocs\"></div>\n<pre><code>src_path: <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/#std\">std</a>.<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/Build/#std.Build\">Build</a>.<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/Build/#std.Build.LazyPath\">LazyPath</a></code></pre><div class=\"fieldDocs\"></div>\n<pre><code>exclude_extensions: <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/Build/Configuration/#std.Build.Configuration\">Configuration</a>.<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/Build/Configuration/#std.Build.Configuration.OptionalStringList\">OptionalStringList</a></code></pre><div class=\"fieldDocs\"></div>\n<pre><code>include_extensions: <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/Build/Configuration/#std.Build.Configuration\">Configuration</a>.<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/Build/Configuration/#std.Build.Configuration.OptionalStringList\">OptionalStringList</a></code></pre><div class=\"fieldDocs\"></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"api-entry\" id=\"std.Build.Step.WriteFile.Embed\"><h3><code>std.Build.Step.WriteFile.Embed</code></h3>\n<p class=\"api-kind\">别名</p>\n<p class=\"api-source\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><a href=\"#L36\">第 36 行</a></p>\n<p>别名目标 <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/Build/Configuration/#std.Build.Configuration.Step.WriteFile.Embed\"><code>std.Build.Configuration.Step.WriteFile.Embed</code></a></p>\n</section>\n<section class=\"api-entry\" id=\"std.Build.Step.WriteFile.getDirectory\"><h3><code>std.Build.Step.WriteFile.getDirectory</code></h3>\n<p class=\"api-kind\">函数</p>\n<p class=\"api-source\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><a href=\"#L163\">第 163 行</a></p>\n<div class=\"api-description\"><p>返回表示基目录的 <code>LazyPath</code>，该目录包含此 <code><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/Build/Step/WriteFile/#std.Build.Step.WriteFile\">WriteFile</a></code>\n中的所有文件。</p>\n</div>\n<pre class=\"api-prototype\"><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">pub</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">getDirectory</span>(wf: *<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/Build/Step/WriteFile/#std.Build.Step.WriteFile\">WriteFile</a>) <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/#std\">std</a>.<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/Build/#std.Build\">Build</a>.<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/Build/#std.Build.LazyPath\">LazyPath</a></code></pre>\n<h4>参数</h4><div class=\"api-parameters\">\n<pre><code>wf: *<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/Build/Step/WriteFile/#std.Build.Step.WriteFile\">WriteFile</a></code></pre>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"api-entry\" id=\"std.Build.Step.WriteFile.maybeUpdateName\"><h3><code>std.Build.Step.WriteFile.maybeUpdateName</code></h3>\n<p class=\"api-kind\">函数</p>\n<p class=\"api-source\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><a href=\"#L167\">第 167 行</a></p>\n<pre class=\"api-prototype\"><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">maybeUpdateName</span>(wf: *<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/Build/Step/WriteFile/#std.Build.Step.WriteFile\">WriteFile</a>) <span class=\"tok-type\">void</span></code></pre>\n<h4>参数</h4><div class=\"api-parameters\">\n<pre><code>wf: *<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/Build/Step/WriteFile/#std.Build.Step.WriteFile\">WriteFile</a></code></pre>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"api-entry\" id=\"std.Build.Step.WriteFile.Mode\"><h3><code>std.Build.Step.WriteFile.Mode</code></h3>\n<p class=\"api-kind\">容器</p>\n<p class=\"api-source\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><a href=\"#L19\">第 19 行</a></p>\n<h4>字段</h4><div class=\"api-fields\">\n<pre><code>whole_cached</code></pre><div class=\"fieldDocs\"><p>默认模式。与缓存系统集成。\nmake 阶段目录应为只读。\n不同输入会产生不同的“o”子目录。</p>\n</div>\n<pre><code>tmp</code></pre><div class=\"fieldDocs\"><p>在此模式下，目录放在“tmp”而非“o”内部，并跳过缓存。\n在 <code>make</code> 阶段，此步骤始终执行全部文件系统操作。构建成功结束时，将与其他临时目录一起删除该目录。\n因此，其他步骤可以修改此目录。</p>\n</div>\n<pre><code>mutate: <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/#std\">std</a>.<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/Build/#std.Build\">Build</a>.<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/Build/#std.Build.LazyPath\">LazyPath</a></code></pre><div class=\"fieldDocs\"><p>操作不会作用于新创建的目录，\n而是作用于临时目录。</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"api-entry\" id=\"std.Build.Step.WriteFile.std\"><h3><code>std.Build.Step.WriteFile.std</code></h3>\n<p class=\"api-kind\">别名</p>\n<p class=\"api-source\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><a href=\"#L6\">第 6 行</a></p>\n<p>别名目标 <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/#std\"><code>std</code></a></p>\n</section>\n<section class=\"api-entry\" id=\"std.Build.Step.WriteFile.Step\"><h3><code>std.Build.Step.WriteFile.Step</code></h3>\n<p class=\"api-kind\">别名</p>\n<p class=\"api-source\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><a href=\"#L7\">第 7 行</a></p>\n<p>别名目标 <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/Build/Step/#std.Build.Step\"><code>std.Build.Step</code></a></p>\n</section>\n<section class=\"api-entry\" id=\"std.Build